WEBVTT

00:00:00.667 --> 00:00:02.423
Out of every 1,000 buyers,

00:00:02.443 --> 00:00:04.621
only 19 ever book a showing.

00:00:05.323 --> 00:00:08.580
The other 981 didn’t say no.

00:00:09.867 --> 00:00:12.239
DealerEdge qualifies every lead first,

00:00:12.259 --> 00:00:15.736
asking the questions your best rep would ask.

00:00:17.033 --> 00:00:19.184
Then it books the showing straight onto the calendar,

00:00:19.204 --> 00:00:22.020
and sends the buyer an invite.

00:00:23.333 --> 00:00:24.686
It goes to the right rep.

00:00:24.877 --> 00:00:25.763
Mike knows that model,

00:00:25.783 --> 00:00:27.345
so Mike gets John.

00:00:28.633 --> 00:00:30.369
It works nights and weekends too.

00:00:31.419 --> 00:00:33.713
After-hours booking is one tap.

00:00:35.000 --> 00:00:37.395
The result: 60 bookings instead of 19,

00:00:37.415 --> 00:00:40.033
from the same 1,000 buyers.

00:00:42.000 --> 00:00:43.875
Book a demo with DealerEdge.
